{"step_index":3596,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T19:29:11Z","thinking":"The target cell calculates the sum of B3, B4, and B5. B3 represents the total matched items across six warehouses. Summing the rows for each warehouse yields 71 matched items.\n\n\n`B4` indicates 435 items not found, and `B5` indicates 140 items needing review. Summing the matched, not found, and review items (71 + 435 + 140) yields 646. This differs from the unique shortage count (591) because a single shortage could be matched in multiple locations or be in review at one warehouse and found at another, leading to double-counting across the warehouses. Also, the order lines are 993, but there are only 591 unique medicines requested.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect review items in results_PROC-001.xlsx","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import openpyxl\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfile_path = Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-001\\results_PROC-001.xlsx\")\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(file_path, data_only=True)\nws = wb[\"يحتاج مراجعة\"]\n\nprint(f\"Total rows in 'يحتاج مراجعة': {ws.max_row}\")\nheaders = [ws.cell(1, c).value for c in range(1, ws.max_column + 1)]\nprint(\"Headers:\", headers)\n\nprint(\"\\n--- First 20 items in 'يحتاج مراجعة' ---\")\nfor r in range(2, 22):\n    row_vals = [ws.cell(r, c).value for c in range(1, ws.max_column + 1)]\n    print(f\"Row {r}: {row_vals}\")\n\n# Group by reason or pattern\nfrom collections import Counter\nreasons = [ws.cell(r, 6).value for r in range(2, ws.max_row + 1)]\nprint(\"\\n--- Common reasons ---\")\nfor reason, count in Counter(reasons).most_common(10):\n    print(f\"  [{count} times] {reason}\")\n","Description":"Inspect items and reasons in يحتاج مراجعة","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\ins